WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
Come with me to Pizza Moon
at Universal Epic Universe.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.600
This is a pizzeria housed in a
transformed early 1900s Victorian theater.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.500
The decor and lighting outside make
this a super unique place to eat,

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.480
and the oven is even a crashed
rocket ship, which is really cool.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.741
They have a variety of pizzas and pastas,

00:00:17.741 --> 00:00:20.400
even a pizza that has
barbecue potato chips on it,

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.200
but I kept it safe with the Nana Rosa.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.760
This was like an elevated margarita
pizza, and it was so good.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.469
Pizza there is doughy,
it's tangy, and it has that

00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:31.340
classic taste that the oven
here is delivering to it.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.527
This is one of the better
in-park pizzas that I've

00:00:33.527 --> 00:00:35.780
honestly ever had at any
theme park that I've been to.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:38.580
Overall, I love the ambiance
and the food here at Pizza Moon,

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.167
and I think it's a great
quick stop at Epic Universe,

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.420
so don't miss it on your
next visit to the park.
